1
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:16,135
今天来试试2026新款雷克萨斯ES 350h。
Today we are driving the all-new 2026 Lexus ES 350h.

2
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,736
这回选的是顶配的前驱版。
This is the premium front-wheel drive.

3
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:21,856
这台测试车的售价，大概在五万三千美金左右，折合人民币差不多三十八万。
As tested, this is about $53,000.

4
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:25,734
内饰配的是帕洛米诺棕，质感确实很棒。
We have the palomino interior, which looks very nice on here.

5
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,860
车身尺寸上，比老款要更大了一些。
A little bit larger ES for the 2026 model year.

6
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:31,440
而且，这次是彻头彻尾的换代，里里外外都是新的。
Of course this is a fully redesigned inside and out.

7
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:35,375
它有两种动力可选：纯电版，以及像咱们这台350h的混动版。
It's available as an EV or as this 350h hybrid.

8
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,617
咱们这台是前驱的。
This is the front-wheel drive model.

9
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:40,298
当然，混动版也有四驱可选。
You can also get the hybrid in all-wheel drive.

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:44,193
官方数据显示，它高速巡航的油耗大概在百公里4.9升左右。
As specified, this gets about 48 miles per gallon on the highway.

11
00:00:44,193 --> 00:00:46,254
市区大概百公里5.4升，综合下来5.1升左右。
About 44 in the city, 46 combined.

12
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:49,089
这油耗表现相当惊人。
Which is an amazing fuel economy.

13
00:00:49,089 --> 00:00:51,289
综合马力有244匹。
244 net combined horsepower.

14
00:00:51,289 --> 00:00:54,460
内外饰都是全新的设计。
And a completely new interior and exterior.

15
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,822
我带大家先绕车看一圈。
Let's walk you guys around it.

16
00:00:55,822 --> 00:00:58,919
刚才开了三四十分钟，跟大家聊聊我的感受。
Talk about what it's been like to spend the first 30 to 40 minutes.

17
00:00:58,919 --> 00:01:00,783
开这台车的时候。
Behind the wheel of this car.

18
00:01:00,783 --> 00:01:03,579
分享一下初驾感受。
And give you guys some first driving impressions.

19
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:05,299
先从内饰说起。
Let's start off with this interior.

20
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:07,500
感觉跟雷克萨斯TZ很像。
Very similar to the Lexus TZ.

21
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:13,370
前几个视频里，我们已经带大家看过外观，算是做过预告了。
that we did a walk-around or a teaser of a couple of videos ago.

22
00:01:13,370 --> 00:01:17,845
这里是一块14.5英寸的超大触摸屏。
So we've got this massive 14.5-inch touchscreen.

23
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:22,730
和新款丰田RAV4那块很像，我觉得挺好。
It's very similar to what we've seen in the new Toyota RAV4, and I like that.

24
00:01:22,730 --> 00:01:24,220
不过纯电版的ES有些不同。
Except for the EV Lexus ES.

25
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:28,250
它带了很多路线规划功能，这点很难得。
It has lots of route planning features which is really nice to see.

26
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:33,250
这块屏幕里有详细的空调设置菜单，但下面也保留了实体的空调按键。
You've got a whole climate menu right here, but you have physical climate buttons right here.

27
00:01:33,250 --> 00:01:37,210
是实实在在可以按下去的实体键，不是那种模拟触感的虚拟按键。
They're push-in, they're not haptic like they look like they are.

28
00:01:37,210 --> 00:01:42,510
这里分别是前风挡除雾、音量旋钮，还有独立的双闪警示灯开关。
We've got a front defrost volume physical button for your hazard switch.

29
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:44,967
还有USB-C接口。下方这排按钮呢...
USB-C ports and then buttons down here.

30
00:01:44,967 --> 00:01:48,436
分别是电子手刹、自动驻车、纯电模式，以及关闭牵引力控制。
for your parking brake, brake hold, EV mode, and traction off.

31
00:01:48,450 --> 00:01:55,450
高配版只有倒车影像，不过顶配版据我所知是有360全景的。
The Premium only comes with a reverse camera, though I think the Premium Plus has the 360-degree camera.

32
00:01:55,450 --> 00:01:57,726
这个内饰材料真的很棒。
We have some really nice materials in this interior.

33
00:01:57,730 --> 00:01:59,602
还是入门版的情况下。
For just being the base model.

34
00:01:59,602 --> 00:02:03,541
仪表台旁边就有一大块翻毛皮（Alcantara）。
You've got this nice suede Alcantara piece right next to the gauge cluster.

35
00:02:03,541 --> 00:02:07,170
屏幕又亮又清晰，显示效果非常精致。
The screens are bright and high-resolution; the graphics look beautiful.

36
00:02:07,170 --> 00:02:11,960
在显示效果上，这绝对是雷克萨斯的一大进步，我很喜欢。
Definitely a step up for Lexus in terms of graphical display quality here, which I appreciate.

37
00:02:11,970 --> 00:02:15,384
这里有调节亮度的快捷按钮。
You have some quick access controls here to adjust brightness.

38
00:02:15,384 --> 00:02:19,883
挺方便的，不过这只对中控屏有效，不是所有屏幕都行。
Which is great, though that is only in the infotainment, not for all displays.

39
00:02:19,890 --> 00:02:20,890
那理应所有屏幕都能调啊。
It should be for everything.

40
00:02:20,890 --> 00:02:23,324
真搞不懂雷克萨斯为什么老是这样。
I don't know why Lexus always does that.

41
00:02:23,330 --> 00:02:25,026
CarPlay是无线的，超方便。
CarPlay is wireless, it's massive

42
00:02:25,026 --> 00:02:27,570
所有应用、所有信息，一目了然。
You can see everything, all your apps, all at once

43
00:02:27,570 --> 00:02:29,649
这点很棒。
Which is always a good thing

44
00:02:29,650 --> 00:02:32,747
座椅带加热和通风功能。
And you've got some temperature control here: heated and ventilated seats

45
00:02:32,747 --> 00:02:34,822
温度可以自动调节。
You can automatically set those

46
00:02:34,822 --> 00:02:40,646
方向盘带加热，前面还有一个无线充电板。
Heated steering wheel and one wireless charge pad right here

47
00:02:40,650 --> 00:02:45,481
中控台两边都能开，而且后排空间特别大。
The center console opens up from both sides, and there is just an enormous amount of rear

48
00:02:45,490 --> 00:02:48,565
后排空间特别大，我到车外给你看看这车的样子。
Seat room, I'll talk outside and show you what this thing looks like

49
00:02:48,570 --> 00:02:53,875
这是雷克萨斯全新的设计语言。
It is a striking new design for Lexus

50
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:58,844
这款ES采用铱银色涂装，非常显档次。
This is painted in Iridium Silver, a nice-looking color on this ES

51
00:02:58,844 --> 00:03:04,603
能看出凯美瑞和普锐斯的影子。
A little bit of language taken from the Camry from the Prius

52
00:03:04,603 --> 00:03:07,944
现在很多丰田新车都这样。
From a lot of Toyota's new models

53
00:03:07,950 --> 00:03:10,121
标配就是19英寸轮毂。
This has the standard 19-inch wheels

54
00:03:10,121 --> 00:03:13,257
混动版只提供19英寸这一个轮毂选项。
19s are the only wheel option on the Hybrid

55
00:03:13,257 --> 00:03:15,508
哎，刚好有飞机飞过。
As a jet flies over us

56
00:03:15,510 --> 00:03:22,660
这是235/55R19的普利司通Turanza EL 450轮胎。
Anyway, these are 235/55R19 Bridgestone Turanza EL 450 tires

57
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:26,310
安静，抓地强，还省油。懂的都懂。
Quiet, grippy, efficient. You guys know the deal

58
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:29,007
看侧面线条。
Take a look at the side profile

59
00:03:29,010 --> 00:03:31,220
看看这个新门把手。
Look at these new door handles

60
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:37,190
实际用起来很顺手，同时也没耽误空气动力学设计。
They actually work really well while maintaining some aerodynamic advantages

61
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:40,744
这台新ES的车尾，第一眼确实挺吸引人的。
The rear view of this new ES is pretty striking.

62
00:03:40,744 --> 00:03:45,020
我很喜欢这个溜背造型，线条从车顶一直顺下来，延伸到尾箱。
I like the roofline, the way it tapers down into the trunk.

63
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:52,725
看这里，现在用的是字母车标，不是以前那种大尺寸的雷克萨斯徽章了。
Now I have a Lexus text instead of a full-on Lexus badge.

64
00:03:52,730 --> 00:03:55,205
所有ES的后备箱，都是电动开启的。
All ES trunks are power-operated.

65
00:03:55,205 --> 00:04:00,335
而且你看这后备箱，空间巨大无比。
and then there is just an enormous amount of trunk space in the back of this.

66
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:03,265
再强调一次，我这台是插电混动版本，既能加油也能纯电行驶。
Again, this package is both a Hybrid and an EV.

67
00:04:03,265 --> 00:04:06,750
不管你开哪种模式，后排的空间都超级充裕。
You get tons of room in the back no matter what you're running.

68
00:04:06,750 --> 00:04:10,320
我先把背包放这儿，免得待会儿评测的时候它在车里乱飞。
I'm just going to put the backpack here so it doesn't fly around during the review.

69
00:04:10,330 --> 00:04:13,590
按一下这里，尾箱就自动关上了。
Press this button to close that trunk.

70
00:04:13,590 --> 00:04:15,071
看看这尾箱的开口，多大！
Look at that opening.

71
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,270
尾灯造型挺酷的。
Taillights are pretty cool looking.

72
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:19,946
后面就一条灯带。
You've got that single strip in the back.

73
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:22,810
这车一箱油将近能跑一千公里。
This will do almost 600 miles on a tank.

74
00:04:22,810 --> 00:04:26,710
所以这ES 350h的混动续航能力真的很强。
So hybrid range here with the ES 350 h is fantastic.

75
00:04:26,710 --> 00:04:29,625
后排有几个USB接口。
We've got a couple USB ports back here.

76
00:04:29,625 --> 00:04:31,215
出风口也是高配专属。
And these premium vents.

77
00:04:31,215 --> 00:04:34,070
后排大概就这些配置了。
And that's kind of about it.

78
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:36,166
腿部空间巨大无比。
Enormous amounts of legroom.

79
00:04:36,166 --> 00:04:37,063
看看这个。
Look at this.

80
00:04:37,063 --> 00:04:42,420
后排这腿部空间，完全是雷克萨斯LS级别的。
This is just Lexus LS amounts of legroom back here.

81
00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:43,472
质感不错。
Nice materials.

82
00:04:43,472 --> 00:04:45,313
内饰是新款Luxe版。
This is the new Luxe interior.

83
00:04:45,313 --> 00:04:50,010
这儿杯架、水瓶架都配齐了。
Got some cup holders, water bottle holders right there.

84
00:04:50,010 --> 00:04:53,567
内饰就是漂亮、开阔，又宽敞又透气。
Just a nice, open, spacious, airy interior.

85
00:04:53,570 --> 00:04:56,228
车窗的腰线设计得很低。
Pretty low beltline with the windows.

86
00:04:56,230 --> 00:04:58,954
我觉得坐这儿挺舒服的。
I think this is a very nice place to be.

87
00:04:58,954 --> 00:05:00,543
而且非常安静。
It's very quiet in here too.

88
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:04,511
门把手也是电动的。
Of course, you've got these same electronically operated door handles.

89
00:05:04,511 --> 00:05:08,365
万一失灵，手动拉两下就能开门。
You can pull them out twice to manually operate them if something happens.

90
00:05:08,365 --> 00:05:14,537
不过用起来真的很方便。
But it's nice to just have these that are easy to operate.

91
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,132
掀开引擎盖看看。
Pop the hood, take a look at this.

92
00:05:17,132 --> 00:05:21,020
2.5升自吸发动机。
2.5 liter naturally aspirated engine.

93
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:23,974
各种提示音哔哔叭叭的。
Lots of beeping and bonging.

94
00:05:23,974 --> 00:05:26,084
引擎盖带液压支撑。
We have hood struts.

95
00:05:26,084 --> 00:05:27,350
瞧这儿。
Look at that.

96
00:05:27,350 --> 00:05:29,614
这布局整整齐齐的。
This all looks very well packaged.

97
00:05:29,614 --> 00:05:33,576
塑料护板设计得挺不错。
Nicely presented here with the plastic engine cover.

98
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:35,937
而且效率会超级高。
And it's going to be enormously efficient.

99
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:38,878
这是雷克萨斯第六代混动系统。
This is Lexus's 6th generation hybrid system.

100
00:05:38,878 --> 00:05:41,138
开起来更顺，噪音更小，整体质感提升。
It's smoother, it's quieter, it's more refined.

101
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:47,130
而且还得加0W-8机油。
And it takes 0W-8 engine oil.

102
00:05:47,130 --> 00:05:48,927
快看这个。
Look at that.

103
00:05:48,930 --> 00:05:50,804
真不敢想象哪天出现0W-0机油。
Can't wait for 0W-0 someday.

104
00:05:50,810 --> 00:05:53,106
来看看这个门把手。
Check out these door handles.

105
00:05:53,106 --> 00:06:00,119
里面藏了个实体按键，按下去就能把门把手往外拉出来。
There's a little button that's an actual button you pull inside the handle.

106
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,838
用起来特别顺手，很有质感。
Super easy to use, very satisfying.

107
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:07,992
这边还有一排按键，藏得挺巧妙，跟仪表台材质融为一体。
More buttons right here that are kind of hidden and integrated nicely into the dashboard material.

108
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:11,920
主驾座椅记忆有三组，四门车窗都带一键升降。
3-seat memory settings, auto up/down windows for all four corners.

109
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,964
这儿轻轻一按，就能打开后备箱。
You've got a button right here to pop your trunk.

110
00:06:13,964 --> 00:06:18,437
油箱盖，还有这个仪表亮度调节，用的是个物理旋钮。
Your fuel filler cap, and then here's your gauge cluster brightness that's a physical switch.

111
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:26,713
所以好在它没被藏着掖着，这点得给雷克萨斯点个赞。
So at least that's not hidden somewhere, thank you, Lexus, for giving us that.

112
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,178
这套内饰看着挺不错。
It's a nice-looking interior.

113
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:31,943
一开始，我对这个方向盘的橡胶材质挺中意的。
At first, I was a big fan of this rubberized steering wheel material.

114
00:06:31,943 --> 00:06:36,354
但用了大概一个小时之后，我的想法有点变了。
But after using it for about an hour, I'm not so sure.

115
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:39,856
摸起来质感有点偏塑料，不过倒也还行。
It just feels kind of plasticky, but I guess it's okay.

116
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:40,860
手感确实非常顺滑。
It's super smooth.

117
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:43,460
方向盘后面带了手感很棒的换挡拨片。
You've got nice paddle shifters behind the wheel.

118
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:46,282
转向灯拨杆用起来质感很到位。
Turn signal operation feels really good here.

119
00:06:46,282 --> 00:06:53,337
另外，定速巡航、音量调节这些功能都保留了实体按键。
And then we've got physical buttons for our cruise control and our track volume selection, all that stuff.

120
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:58,900
下面这排按键手感很扎实，表面带旋纹，触感特别清晰。
These lower buttons feel really nice in hand. They're kind of grippy and knurled, which feels very good.

121
00:06:58,900 --> 00:07:02,020
仪表盘布局这里有好几种预设方案。
And then you've got a bunch of configurations here for your gauge clusters.

122
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:05,082
当然，你也可以自定义这些不同的主题风格。
Of course you can customize these variations on a theme.

123
00:07:05,082 --> 00:07:10,328
从雷克萨斯和丰田其他车型的仪表设计来看，这些方案都挺眼熟的。
From what we've seen from Lexus and Toyota and their other cluster designs.

124
00:07:10,330 --> 00:07:13,090
这里有个实用的ECO CHARGE功率表。
So you've got a nice EcoCharge power meter there.

125
00:07:13,090 --> 00:07:16,246
这种双炮筒布局我喜欢，用起来很方便。
I like this dual pod layout, it's pretty useful.

126
00:07:16,250 --> 00:07:19,998
接下来我们聊聊它的车机系统。
Let's delve into this infotainment system some.

127
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,414
它自带原车导航。
So we've got our native navigation.

128
00:07:22,414 --> 00:07:28,283
主界面有些功能卡片，显示音乐、电话、驾驶模式这些信息。
You've got some different widgets here showing you your music, your phone, your drive mode.

129
00:07:28,283 --> 00:07:32,560
而且这些模块都可以自定义，自由度很高。
And then you can customize all of this stuff, which is great.

130
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:37,782
还能查看天气、多媒体，自定义好的设置也能保存下来。
You can see your weather, your media, and then save all of that.

131
00:07:37,790 --> 00:07:39,430
挺酷的。
Very cool.

132
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:42,790
这个气候菜单，功能上没啥惊喜。
The climate menu doesn't really give you much more functionality.

133
00:07:42,790 --> 00:07:47,142
应该能自定义一些功能，像是S Flow除霜这种。
I guess you can customize different things like S Flow de icer.

134
00:07:47,142 --> 00:07:49,814
还能自动调节座椅温度。
And then auto adjust the seat temperature.

135
00:07:49,814 --> 00:07:54,364
但常用的温度和风量控制，都在这儿，操作起来很方便。
But most of your controls for temperature and fan speed are easily accessible right here.

136
00:07:54,370 --> 00:07:56,229
有些图标设计得偏小了点。
Some of these icons are a little bit small.

137
00:07:56,229 --> 00:08:01,406
不过屏幕下面有个小凸起，能把手放稳，这个设计挺人性化的。
But you've got a little ridge underneath the screen to rest and stabilize your hand, which I appreciate.

138
00:08:01,410 --> 00:08:06,039
座椅加热通风、方向盘加热，这些当然都配齐了。
Of course, heated and ventilated seats, heated steering wheel, all that stuff.

139
00:08:06,039 --> 00:08:08,830
温度控制键就在旁边。
And then your temperature control is right there.

140
00:08:08,830 --> 00:08:11,921
音量用的是滑动条，操作感很好，刚才也提到过。
Volume is a nice slider, and like I mentioned earlier.

141
00:08:11,921 --> 00:08:19,277
这台顶配雷克萨斯ES 350h，倒车影像就只给了一个。
We only get a reverse camera in this premium Lexus ES 350 h.

142
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,200
还有啥要讲的吗？
Anything else I need to cover?

143
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,584
这个遮阳板，是能推拉的。
Here are the visors, they slide.

144
00:08:23,584 --> 00:08:27,161
配的是个大尺寸的全景天窗。
We've got a big panoramic sunroof there.

145
00:08:27,161 --> 00:08:32,795
这座椅看着挺单薄，但实际坐上去填充很足，非常舒服，这点我很喜欢。
The seats are nice and thin but very well padded and comfortable, appreciate that.

146
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:35,642
这个盖板可以把杯架和水瓶槽都盖住。
You can hide your water bottle and cup holders with this.

147
00:08:35,642 --> 00:08:39,600
下面也有一点储物空间，还带了氛围灯。
And there's a little bit of storage underneath here as well as some ambient lighting.

148
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:43,590
现在大白天的，可能看不太出来。
That you probably can't see too well during the day right now.

149
00:08:43,590 --> 00:08:46,201
咱们上路试试。
Let's head out onto the road.

150
00:08:46,201 --> 00:08:48,812
开始导航。
We will enable our route.

151
00:08:48,812 --> 00:08:52,169
咱们先去熟悉一下路线。
We've got a route to scan here.

152
00:08:52,170 --> 00:09:08,095
然后，跟大家聊聊开这台新款雷克萨斯ES的第一感受。
And let's give you guys some first driving impressions on this new Lexus ES.

153
00:09:08,100 --> 00:09:21,204
掉个头，费了好大劲，跟《王牌大贱谍》里演的似的，来回挪了四把。
Doing Austin Powers four-point turn here, looks like we're going right so we don't.

154
00:09:21,210 --> 00:09:23,845
这个红灯怕是要等上十分钟了。
Need to wait ten minutes for this traffic light to turn.

155
00:09:23,850 --> 00:09:31,753
新款ES给人的第一感觉，就是又平顺又有劲。
The biggest thing you notice with this new ES is just how smooth and torquey it is.

156
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:34,906
发动机噪音很小，NVH控制得相当到位。
Very little engine noise, very little NVH.

157
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:40,521
就这车的定位来说，底盘比我预想的要偏硬一点。
The ride is slightly firmer than I was expecting it to be for what this car is.

158
00:09:40,521 --> 00:09:46,660
不过速度起来之后，底盘滤震就显得很干脆，高级感很强。
But once you get up to speed, it seems really nicely damped and really well isolated.

159
00:09:46,660 --> 00:10:01,268
车身姿态很稳，在运动感和舒适性之间取得了不错的平衡。
Good body control, it's a nice blend between sporting intentions but also good ride comfort.

160
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:12,494
油门响应很跟脚，普通模式下也是随踩随有，动力储备很充足。
Throttle response, even in normal mode, is pretty instant and overall power feels great.

161
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:16,052
刹车脚感标定得很棒，既线性又跟脚。
Brake pedal calibration: linear and responsive.

162
00:10:16,052 --> 00:10:22,760
完全没有丰田、雷克萨斯混动上常有的那种刹车初段虚位和模糊感。
None of that hybrid squish that sometimes we get in Toyota and Lexus hybrids.

163
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:29,190
新款ES的整体质感都调得更紧致、更到位了。
Everything just feels a little bit tighter, a little bit better calibrated in this new ES.

164
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:33,978
话说回来，内饰虽然设计挺简洁的，
And I feel like even though this is a pretty basic, simple interior,

165
00:10:33,978 --> 00:10:38,826
但实用性很强，屏幕里的功能操作起来都很顺手、很快。
It's functional enough; the stuff on the screen is easily and quickly accessible.

166
00:10:38,826 --> 00:10:44,093
用料质感也比雷克萨斯前两年的一些新车要好。
And the materials feel like an improvement over what Lexus has maybe been giving us.

167
00:10:44,093 --> 00:10:51,520
（承接上句）这点在新车上能明显感觉到。
Over the last couple of years in some of their new products.

168
00:10:51,520 --> 00:11:09,780
新车毫无松散感，也没有异响，高速风噪也控制得很细微。
No shakes, no rattles, very little wind noise in this new ES.

169
00:11:09,780 --> 00:11:31,420
光凭那台44马力的电机，动力就够用，超车轻松。
44 horsepower for getting in front of the Prius.

170
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:40,965
而且开起来还特别轻快、灵活，视野也很开阔，真有点惊喜。
It also feels surprisingly light and nimble on its feet, agile, and I have good visibility.

171
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:44,445
总的来说，这是台挺不错的车。
If you want the full summary, it's a perfectly fine automobile.

172
00:11:44,450 --> 00:11:51,590
价格我觉得还行。不过要是能多给点高配的功能就更好了。
I don't think it's outrageously priced. I could do with some premium plus features in this.

173
00:11:51,590 --> 00:11:53,694
另外，电动车也有顶配版本。
Now the EV has a luxury trim.

174
00:11:53,694 --> 00:11:58,650
不过同配置的话，选电动版能便宜点。
But you save a little bit of money with the EV, trim to trim.

175
00:11:58,650 --> 00:12:00,608
大概能省个两千美金。
This is about 2,000 going with the EV.

176
00:12:00,610 --> 00:12:03,915
当然，需要四驱的话，也能选。
Of course, you could always get this in all-wheel drive if you need it.

177
00:12:03,915 --> 00:12:09,626
但虽然是前驱，抓地力很强，开起来很稳。
But this has great traction in the drive, as a front-wheel drive platform.

178
00:12:09,630 --> 00:12:13,745
这可是雷克萨斯头一回给ES配上四驱。
First time Lexus is ever offering the ES as an all-wheel drive configuration.

179
00:12:13,750 --> 00:12:18,483
我是说，他们技术都有了，干嘛不用上呢？
I mean, they have the powertrains, why not swap them in?

180
00:12:18,490 --> 00:12:22,995
没想到丰田竟然在自家系列里推了这么多电动款。
It's kind of a surprise seeing Toyota add so many EV options to the lineup.

181
00:12:22,995 --> 00:12:26,706
其实就是跟BZ系列上那套一样的电池组。
It's basically just the same packs that we've seen with the BZs.

182
00:12:26,706 --> 00:12:33,609
就是把这套东西，往不同的车上套。
And they're just putting them in a bunch of different models.

183
00:12:33,610 --> 00:12:40,490
不过高配版ES配置就多了，后排座椅那叫一个舒服。
But the luxury ES has a lot more features; it's got lounge chairs in the back.

184
00:12:40,490 --> 00:12:45,719
但要是你就想买个雷克萨斯ES，够用就行，基础款体验。
But if you just want a Lexus ES, the bare necessity, the bare bones experience.

185
00:12:45,719 --> 00:12:48,775
开出去，那个豪华的感觉和气场，照样拉满。
That gives you the luxurious feel and the look.

186
00:12:48,775 --> 00:12:53,090
我看啊，这款ES 350h，可能才是正解。
This ES 350h, I think, is probably going to be the way to go.

187
00:12:53,090 --> 00:12:59,002
混动续航超长，特别省油，坐着也舒服。
It's got tons and tons of driving range as a hybrid, super fuel efficient, very comfortable.

188
00:12:59,010 --> 00:13:02,383
我觉得它完全拿捏了。
I think it kind of hits the nail on the head.

189
00:13:02,383 --> 00:13:04,631
该有的都有，家用完全够用。
And does what you need it to do.

190
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:08,588
真的，唯一觉得缺的，就是那个马克莱文森音响。
Really, the only thing I feel like I'm lacking in here is the Mark Levinson sound.

191
00:13:08,588 --> 00:13:15,810
还有360度全景影像，这些都能选装。
And a 360 cam and you can option those things.

192
00:13:15,810 --> 00:13:33,474
用这套标配音响试试效果。
Let's do a sound system test with our standard sound system here and see what that's like.

193
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:47,400
音量调节在左手边，我变个道，到左边车道。
Volume controls here to the left, we're going to get a left lane on some of this traffic.

194
00:13:47,410 --> 00:13:49,530
依然很清晰。
Still very clear.

195
00:13:49,530 --> 00:14:19,506
说实话，第一印象，这套所谓的‘高端基础版’音响，音质真不错。
Honestly, first impressions, this premium base model sound system sounds great.

196
00:14:19,510 --> 00:14:21,805
我是说，这配置还管它叫‘顶配基础款’。
I mean, they're still calling the base model a premium.

197
00:14:21,805 --> 00:14:26,476
再往上可以选混动高配版。
And then you can upgrade to the premium plus with the hybrid.

198
00:14:26,476 --> 00:14:33,365
要想更豪华，还有纯电版可以选。
And you get the EV if you want to get into luxury, etc.

199
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:36,978
当然，可能比不上Mark Levinson那种顶级货。
Maybe not as sweet as the Mark Levinson would be.

200
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:39,780
Mark Levinson的我还没机会听，但这套已经很好了。
I haven't listened to the Mark Levinson yet, but this is great.

201
00:14:39,780 --> 00:14:51,094
5万3美金这个价位，这音响系统确实牛。
For 53,000, this is a fantastic sound system.

202
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:59,707
而且我觉得雷克萨斯这次内饰的风格，真心挺不错。
I also feel like this is a really nice interior direction for a Lexus.

203
00:14:59,710 --> 00:15:03,850
功能很实用，各种东西的布局和安排也特别合理。
I like the functionality, I like the layout and organization of everything.

204
00:15:03,850 --> 00:15:05,904
上手特别快，用起来也顺手。
It's just easy to acclimate to and easy to use.

205
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:10,757
我一坐进去，立刻就知道各个功能都在哪儿。
I jumped into this car and immediately had an idea of where everything should be.

206
00:15:10,757 --> 00:15:15,191
就连车机系统里，有些设置可能藏得深了一点。
And even in the infotainment, where stuff could be buried a little bit deeper here and there.

207
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:19,985
不过我心里大概有数，知道该去哪儿找。
I felt like I had a good grasp on where different settings should be.

208
00:15:19,990 --> 00:15:22,737
因为大部分设置都整合到这儿了。
They pretty much moved a lot of the settings into here.

209
00:15:22,737 --> 00:15:28,940
不像有些车，得分屏和仪表盘两边找，这点我觉得挺好。
Instead of splitting them up between the screen and the gauge cluster, which I appreciate.

210
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:31,361
内饰这块，我真是没啥可挑的。
I don't really have any complaints about this interior space.

211
00:15:31,370 --> 00:15:35,082
我觉得对雷克萨斯ES来说，这就完全够用了。
I think it does exactly what it needs to do for the Lexus ES.

212
00:15:35,090 --> 00:15:40,761
但它的外观设计，可能会让不少人有意见。
It's the exterior design that might be a point of contention for some buyers.

213
00:15:40,761 --> 00:15:45,788
关键就看你能不能接受这种流线造型和锋利的棱角了。
Whether they're kind of into the swooping lines and crazy hard surfaces.

214
00:15:45,788 --> 00:15:50,330
以及雷克萨斯新设计语言的种种变化。
And all the things that Lexus has done with their new design language.

215
00:15:50,330 --> 00:15:52,969
不过我觉得大家慢慢还是会看顺眼的。
I think people will ultimately get used to it.

216
00:15:52,970 --> 00:15:54,619
毕竟对有争议的新设计，大家都是这么过来的。
We always do.

217
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:57,297
这车第一眼看上去，确实非常抢眼。
It's a pretty striking car to look at on first impressions.

218
00:15:57,297 --> 00:15:58,969
但也可能会让一些买家望而却步。
And it might turn off a few buyers.

219
00:15:58,980 --> 00:16:16,026
想要更沉稳低调风格的人，这完全可以理解。
Who want something a bit more sedate and subdued, which is understandable.

220
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:19,785
这段烂路开过来，隔音滤震的效果相当不错。
On a pretty bumpy section of road here, NVH is good.

221
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:27,920
说实话，过减速带时感觉比我预想的硬了一点。
Again, it's just a couple of bumps are a bit more harsh than I was expecting with this ES.

222
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:38,788
没有传统雷克萨斯那种招牌的舒适感。
It's not as Lexus soft as I wanted it to be.

223
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:40,990
城市里日常代步，舒适性确实没话说。
Driving around the city, it's super comfy.

224
00:16:40,990 --> 00:16:47,128
油门脚感很顺，响应也线性，这点挑不出毛病。
You've got throttle control that is nice and linear, no complaints there.

225
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:50,656
低速行驶时，大部分时间都在用电。
It'll remain in EV mode pretty readily at lower speeds.

226
00:16:50,656 --> 00:16:59,984
从纯电切换到发动机介入的过程非常平顺，悄无声息，几乎感觉不到。
That transition from EV to internal combustion engine turning on is seamless, it's silent, barely notice it.

227
00:16:59,990 --> 00:17:34,785
这套动力系统的响应真的很棒。
I love how responsive this powertrain is.

228
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:43,722
这台350 H高配版，没有配备自适应悬挂。
There's no adaptive suspension in this 350 H Premium.

229
00:17:43,722 --> 00:17:58,566
所以切换驾驶模式，主要就是方向盘手感和油门灵敏度的变化，其他方面差别不大。
So changing drive modes doesn't really do a whole lot except for steering weight and throttle response.

230
00:17:58,570 --> 00:18:03,361
虽然车身尺寸大了不少，但开起来依然很灵活，一点都不觉得笨重。
Even though it's a much longer and larger car, it doesn't feel difficult or tedious to.

231
00:18:03,370 --> 00:18:04,370
开上路试试。
Place on the road.

232
00:18:04,370 --> 00:18:15,276
车身挺窄的，窄路、小巷子都挺好钻。
It's still narrow enough to fit through small gaps.

233
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:19,314
座椅非常舒服，驾驶视野也很开阔。
Seats are super comfortable and great visibility from this driving position too.

234
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:24,240
这回试驾的线路，可能没机会上高速了。
I don't know if we're going to get a chance to go on the highway with this route.

235
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:27,895
那高速方面，我就先大概说说感受。
So I will just sum up some thoughts on that.

236
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:35,772
雷克萨斯安全辅助系统4.0，或者叫什么来着，表现没问题。
The Lexus Safety Assist 4.0 or whatever it's called is fine.

237
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:38,950
跟以前比，没什么大变化。
It's about the same as it's always been.

238
00:18:38,950 --> 00:18:41,661
车道居中功能做得挺稳的。
The lane centering works well enough.

239
00:18:41,661 --> 00:18:42,745
但也还不完美。
It's not perfect.

240
00:18:42,750 --> 00:18:46,507
自动变道这个功能，对我来说可有可无。
The lane change is something I could probably just do without.

241
00:18:46,510 --> 00:18:47,984
手得一直扶着方向盘。
You have to keep your hands on the wheel.

242
00:18:47,984 --> 00:18:48,386
还行吧。
It does okay.

243
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:51,123
一直哔哔响。
There's a lot of beeping going on.

244
00:18:51,123 --> 00:18:51,943
随便啦。
It's whatever.

245
00:18:51,950 --> 00:18:55,759
跟车距离调整，在这里就能轻松搞定。
Adaptive cruise control following distance changes are easily made right here.

246
00:18:55,759 --> 00:18:57,629
按钮布局基本上没变。
And it's pretty much the same button layout.

247
00:18:57,629 --> 00:19:01,381
在其他丰田和雷克萨斯车型上都有。
That we've had in a lot of other Toyota models and Lexus models.

248
00:19:01,381 --> 00:19:04,706
不过新增了这个触控板。
But just with this new pad here.

249
00:19:04,710 --> 00:19:05,943
用起来还不错。
And it seems to work just fine.

250
00:19:05,943 --> 00:19:07,487
各个按键区分得很清楚。
Everything is nicely differentiated.

251
00:19:07,487 --> 00:19:08,103
这点我挺喜欢的。
And I like that.

252
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:13,620
不用抬头看HUD，就能清楚按的是啥。
I don't have to look up into a head-up display to see what I'm pressing.

253
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:16,350
雷克萨斯现在开始用轮毂盖了。
Lexus is employing the use of wheel covers now.

254
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:19,300
看到它们回归，还挺有意思的。
It's kind of interesting to see those make a comeback.

255
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:22,819
我小时候，每辆车都有轮毂盖。
When I was growing up, every car had hubcaps.

256
00:19:22,819 --> 00:19:26,927
而这些轮毂盖是为了更好的空气动力学表现。
And these are wheel covers for better aerodynamics.

257
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:31,468
其实就是轮毂盖。
Which they're basically hubcaps.

258
00:19:31,470 --> 00:19:39,486
雷克萨斯有三种内饰可选：这个帕勒莫，黑白配色看着特别棒。
Lexus has three interior options: this Palermo, which looks fantastic in black and white.

259
00:19:39,490 --> 00:19:42,649
值得注意的是，现在所有ES车型都
Something that I will note is that there is a

260
00:19:42,649 --> 00:19:45,565
内置了行车记录仪。
Built-in dash camera in all Lexus ES models now.

261
00:19:45,570 --> 00:19:49,448
它藏在上面这里，所以是集成进去的。
It's hidden, so it's integrated into somewhere up here.

262
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:54,074
基本上我一加速或者刹车，它就响。
Going off pretty much every time I accelerated and hit the brakes.

263
00:19:54,074 --> 00:19:58,252
所以我得去设置里调一下，因为它默认是正常灵敏度。
So I had to go into the settings to adjust it, as it was set to normal sensitivity.

264
00:19:58,252 --> 00:20:00,872
根本就不太对劲。
Which was not acting normally at all.

265
00:20:00,872 --> 00:20:06,360
它表现得好像我在圣地亚哥瞎开车一样。
It was acting like I was just doing some crazy stuff driving around San Diego.

266
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:09,080
我可能确实有点乱来，但我也说不准。
And I guess maybe I am a little bit, but I don't know.

267
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:14,600
我把灵敏度关了，这样只在气囊弹出时才录像。
I turned the sensitivity completely off so that it only records when there's an airbag trigger.

268
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:20,210
或者你也可以手动录像其他东西。
And I guess you could manually record stuff otherwise or.

269
00:20:20,210 --> 00:20:25,020
可以直接调取循环录制的视频。
Just tap into a looped recording from your drive.

270
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:30,793
这不是行车记录仪最顺畅的安装方式。
It's not the most seamless integration of a dash cam.

271
00:20:30,793 --> 00:20:36,830
不过习惯了其实也还行。
But I think once you get used to it, it's okay.

272
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:43,786
主页上可以直接点这里来记录行程。
There is this home page where you can go up here and record an event.

273
00:20:43,786 --> 00:20:46,684
所以打开起来特别快。
So you can access that pretty quickly.

274
